-- Seed source-backed project drafts after both marketplace migrations succeed.
-- This inserts only missing categories/projects; conflicts are left unchanged.
-- Draft projects have a NULL price until an administrator sets an approved sale price.
-- Titles use the source wording in both locale columns to avoid inventing translations.
-- Do not publish these drafts until their titles, prices, documentation, and images are reviewed.

